# Python oracles of the oracle image (chapter 14 §14.2.6, §14.4.13, §14.4.14; WI-0.554). Direct pins only;
# requirements.txt is compiled from this file (see ORACLE_VERSIONS.md, "Changing a pin").
# The google/uvq revision pinned in the Dockerfile (UVQ 1.5 and the PyTorch port of UVQ 1.0) asks for
# torch==2.8.0, torchvision==0.23.0, tqdm==4.67.1, numpy==2.1.2 and pandas==2.2.3. torch and torchvision are
# the CPU-only builds from the PyTorch index (no CUDA libraries); ONNX export uses the built-in torch.onnx.
# Pillow stays at the version the previous UVQ revision asked for; Daala's tools/dump_ciede2000.py needs
# scikit-image and y4m; tools/gen_fixture_fb.py (synthetic FlatBuffers fixtures) needs flatbuffers.
